  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://jarvis.local/catbook/resource/context%3Aintroduction">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://jarvis.local/catbook/ontology#Need"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://jarvis.local/catbook/ontology#CatbookConcept"/>
    <rdfs:label>합사 첫 단계</rdfs:label>
    <cat:nodeId>context:introduction</cat:nodeId>
    <cat:classId>Need</cat:classId>
    <rdfs:comment>첫 만남보다 냄새, 문, 밥자리, 도망갈 길을 먼저 설계한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <cat:summary>첫 만남보다 냄새, 문, 밥자리, 도망갈 길을 먼저 설계한다.</cat:summary>
    <cat:beginnerGuide>사랑은 충분조건이 아니다. 합사는 동선과 시간의 설계다.</cat:beginnerGuide>
    <cat:color>#7C3AED</cat:color>
    <cat:evidenceCount rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">84</cat:evidenceCount>
    <cat:observePoint>냄새 교환</cat:observePoint>
    <cat:observePoint>분리 공간</cat:observePoint>
    <cat:observePoint>식사 거리</cat:observePoint>
    <cat:observePoint>퇴로</cat:observePoint>
    <cat:keyword>합사</cat:keyword>
    <cat:keyword>둘째</cat:keyword>
