    <cat:observePoint>청결 주기</cat:observePoint>
    <cat:observePoint>피할 수 있는 동선</cat:observePoint>
    <cat:observePoint>갑작스런 실수</cat:observePoint>
    <cat:keyword>화장실</cat:keyword>
